                                "sense_id": "569fec4d-758c-3ed4-b7fe-74e7093f8879",
                                "text": "Dalio is an outdoorsman and naturalist of the Hemingway school: he likes to go places and kill things. He fishes in Canada, shoots grouse in Scotland, and hunts big game in Africa, […]"
